<title>JAPAN: Japan Dec aluminium alloy output, shipments rise.</title>
<headline>Japan Dec aluminium alloy output, shipments rise.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's output and shipments of aluminium alloy rose in December from the same month a year ago, the Japan Aluminium Alloy Refiners Association said on Friday.</p>
<p>The data was as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>		   Dec 96	 yr/yr change</p>
<p> Output	  79,031	  +5.4 pct</p>
<p> Shipments     79,441	  +5.0 pct</p>
<p> Inventories   23,353	 -11.1 pct</p>
<p>--Tokyo Commodity Desk +81-3-3432-6179</p>
</text>
